          %p
          .proof
            %h6 Proof
            %p
              See
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "#1Lab"} 1Lab
              = succeed "." do
                %em Strong idempotent monads
          %h2#examples Examples
          %ul
            %li
              The free/forgetful adjunction between
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/group"} groups
              and
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/abelian+group"} abelian groups
              generates an idempotent monad.
          %h2#related_concepts Related concepts
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/idempotent+monoid+in+a+monoidal+category"} idempotent monoid in a monoidal category
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/idempotent+adjunction"} idempotent adjunction
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/reflective+subcategory"} reflective subcategory
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/closure+operator"}> closure operator
                ,
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/modality"} modality
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/lax-idempotent+2-monad"} lax-idempotent 2-monad
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/idempotent+%28%E2%88%9E%2C1%29-monad"} idempotent (∞,1)-monad
            %li
              %p
                The analog in
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/model+category"} model category
                theory of the localization at idempotent monad is the content of the
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bousfield-Friedlander+theorem"} Bousfield-Friedlander theorem
                (“
                %span.newWikiWord>
                  Quillen idempotent monad
                  %a{:href => "/nlab/new/Quillen+idempotent+monad"} ?
                ”).
          %h2#References References
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Harry+Appelgate"}> Harry Appelgate
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Myles+Tierney"} Myles Tierney
              = succeed "," do
                %em Categories with models
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Beno+Eckmann"} Beno Eckmann
              (ed.)
              %em Seminar on Triples and Categorical Homology Theory
              Lecture Notes in Mathematics,
              = succeed "," do
                %strong 80
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/BFb0083086"} doi:10.1007/BFb0083086
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://link.springer.com/content/pdf/10.1007/BFb0083086"} pdf
          %p Textbook accounts:
          %ul
            %li#Borceux
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Francis+Borceux"}> Francis Borceux
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Handbook+of+Categorical+Algebra"} Handbook of Categorical Algebra
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Peter+Johnstone"}> Peter Johnstone
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Sketches+of+an+Elephant"} Sketches of an Elephant
          %p See also:
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Pierre+Gabriel"}> Pierre Gabriel
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michel+Zisman"} Michel Zisman
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Calculus+of+fractions+and+homotopy+theory"} Calculus of fractions and homotopy theory
          %p
            The idempotent monad which exhibits the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/localization"} localization
            at the
            = succeed "-equivalences" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi T
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} T
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi T
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} T
            is discussed in
          %ul
            %li#ApplegateTierney70
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Harry+Applegate"}> Harry Applegate
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Myles+Tierney"} Myles Tierney
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Iterated cotriples
                %strong 137
                (1970) 56-99 (
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/BFb0060440"}> doi:10.1007/BFb0060440
                )
            %li#Fakir70
              %p
                S. Fakir,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Monade idempotente associée à une monade
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://gallica.bnf.fr/ark:/12148/bpt6k480298g/f103.image"} gallica
            %li#Day74
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Brian+Day"}> Brian Day
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em On adjoint-functor factorisation
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://link.springer.com/content/pdf/10.1007/BFb0063097.pdf"} springer
            %li#CasacubertaFrei99
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Carles+Casacuberta"}> Carles Casacuberta
                , Armin Frei,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Localizations as idempotent approximations to completions
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://atlas.mat.ub.es/personals/casac/articles/cfre1.pdf"} pdf
          %p
            and for
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/enriched+category+theory"} enriched category theory
            in
          %ul
            %li#LucyshynWright14
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Rory+Lucyshyn-Wright"}> Rory Lucyshyn-Wright
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Completion, closure, and density relative to a monad, with examples in functional analysis and sheaf theory
              %a{:href => "http://emis.ams.org/journals/TAC/volumes/29/31/29-31abs.html"} abs
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1406.2361"} arXiv:1406.2361
          %p
            Discussion in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/algebraic+topology"} algebraic topology
            (
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/localization+of+a+space"}> localization
            ,
            = succeed "):" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/completion+of+a+space"} completion
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/John+Frank+Adams"}> John Frank Adams
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Zbigniew+Fiedorowicz"} Zbigniew Fiedorowicz
              = succeed "," do
                %em Localisation and Completion with an addendum on the use of Brown-Peterson homology in stable homotopy
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1012.5020"} arXiv:1012.5020
          %p Extension of idempotent monads along subcategory inclusions is discussed in
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Carles+Casacuberta"}> Carles Casacuberta
                , Armin Frei, Tan Geok Choo,
                %em Extending localization functors
                , Journal of Pure and Applied Algebra 103 (1995), 149-165 (
                %a{:href => "http://atlas.mat.ub.es/personals/casac/articles/cft.pdf"}> pdf
                )
            %li
              %p
                A. Deleanu, A. Frei,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Peter+Hilton"} P. Hilton
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Idempotent triples and completion
                %strong 143
                (1975) pp.91-104. (
                %a{:href => "http://gdz-lucene.tc.sub.uni-goettingen.de/gcs/gcs?&&action=pdf&metsFile=PPN266833020_0143&divID=LOG_0014&pagesize=original&pdfTitlePage=http://gdz.sub.uni-goettingen.de/dms/load/pdftitle/?metsFile=PPN266833020_0143%7C&targetFileName=PPN266833020_0143_LOG_0014.pdf&"}> pdf
                )
          %p Discussion of idempotent comonads and their relation to adjoint strings is contained in
          %ul
            %li#RosebrughWood95
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Robert+Rosebrugh"}> Robert Rosebrugh
              ,
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Richard+Wood"} Richard Wood
              = succeed "," do
                %em Distributive adjoint strings
          %p
            Formalisation in
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cubical+Agda"} cubical Agda
          %ul
            %li#1Lab
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/1lab"}> 1lab
              ,
              %em
                %a{:href => "https://1lab.dev/Cat.Diagram.Monad.Idempotent.html"} Idempotent monads
